## Original Content
Выданы ордера на арест редактора газеты Denge, руководителя его офиса и автора материала

## Summary
Turkish prosecutors have opened an investigation into a message claiming 'Erdogan died'. Arrest warrants were issued for the editor of the Denge newspaper, the head of his office, and the author of the material.

## Key Points
- A message stating 'Erdogan died' triggered a prosecutorial investigation
- Arrest warrants were issued for three individuals connected to the publication
- Those targeted include the editor of the Denge newspaper, the head of its office, and the author of the article
- The case was reported by the news outlet Odatv


